    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n109818" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὕφεαρ</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αρος</span> (not
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾰτος</span>), τό,
		Arcadian name for <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>mistletoe,
				Viscum album,</i> growing on the <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρῖνος</span> (here =
			<i>Quercus coccifera</i>), <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
